Neural beat detection uses Beat This! (Foscarin, Schlüter and Widmer,
https://github.com/CPJKU/beat_this), Copyright (c) 2024 Institute of
Computational Perception, JKU Linz, through its Rust port beat-this
(https://github.com/danigb/beat-this-rs); code and model weights under the
MIT licence. The weights are downloaded the first time they are needed.

Word timing for lyrics uses whisper.cpp (https://github.com/ggml-org/whisper.cpp),
Copyright (c) 2023-2026 The ggml authors, under the MIT licence, through
whisper-rs (Unlicense), with OpenAI's Whisper large-v3-turbo weights
